QUICK MART — PHASE 2

Complete Elaborative Development Prompt

Advanced Product Catalogue, Smart Shopping Experience & Interactive Cart System

You are an expert full-stack developer working on my existing Quick Mart application.

Your assignment is to upgrade Quick Mart into a complete, interactive shopping experience inspired by the product discovery and browsing experience of applications like Blinkit, Instamart, and Amazon.

This is Phase 2 of an existing project.

