The objective is to transform Quick Mart from a simple predefined-item shopping interface into a comprehensive, category-based product catalogue with a smooth shopping and checkout experience.

The application is primarily a personal shopping and budget-management system. It is NOT intended to become an actual online delivery marketplace.

